---
import GuideLayout from '../../layouts/GuideLayout.astro';
---

<GuideLayout 
  title="Seamless Success: A Step-by-Step Guide to Partnering with FITCLO" 
  type="STRATEGY"
  description="Understanding the manufacturing journey. From initial selection to final delivery, explore our transparent 6-step cooperation process designed for B2B efficiency."
>
  <h2>Transparency in Every Thread: Our Cooperation Process</h2>
  <p>For B2B buyers, choosing a manufacturer is about more than just finding a factory—it's about finding a reliable partner. At <strong>FITCLO</strong>, we have optimized our workflow to ensure speed, clarity, and quality at every stage. Here is how we bring your activewear vision to life.</p>

  <!-- Flowchart Container -->
  <div class="my-16 space-y-12">
    <div class="relative flex items-start gap-8 group">
      <div class="absolute left-6 top-12 w-[2px] h-[calc(100%+24px)] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#C9A84C]/40 to-transparent"></div>
      <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-2 border-[#C9A84C] bg-[#050505] flex items-center justify-center z-10 group-hover:bg-[#C9A84C] group-hover:text-black transition-all duration-300">
        <span class="text-[14px] font-bold font-mono">01</span>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-2">
        <h3 class="text-[20px] font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-[#C9A84C] transition-colors">Browse & Select</h3>
        <p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed text-[15px]">Browse our product catalog and select the styles you're interested in.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative flex items-start gap-8 group">
      <div class="absolute left-6 top-12 w-[2px] h-[calc(100%+24px)] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#C9A84C]/40 to-transparent"></div>
      <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-2 border-[#C9A84C] bg-[#050505] flex items-center justify-center z-10 group-hover:bg-[#C9A84C] group-hover:text-black transition-all duration-300">
        <span class="text-[14px] font-bold font-mono">02</span>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-2">
        <h3 class="text-[20px] font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-[#C9A84C] transition-colors">Send Requirements</h3>
        <p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed text-[15px]">Send us the style numbers, your logo, and any customization requirements.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative flex items-start gap-8 group">
      <div class="absolute left-6 top-12 w-[2px] h-[calc(100%+24px)] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#C9A84C]/40 to-transparent"></div>
      <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-2 border-[#C9A84C] bg-[#050505] flex items-center justify-center z-10 group-hover:bg-[#C9A84C] group-hover:text-black transition-all duration-300">
        <span class="text-[14px] font-bold font-mono">03</span>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-2">
        <h3 class="text-[20px] font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-[#C9A84C] transition-colors">Detailed Quotation</h3>
        <p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed text-[15px]">We'll provide a detailed quotation, including sample cost, production cost, lead time, and shipping options.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative flex items-start gap-8 group">
      <div class="absolute left-6 top-12 w-[2px] h-[calc(100%+24px)] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#C9A84C]/40 to-transparent"></div>
      <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-2 border-[#C9A84C] bg-[#050505] flex items-center justify-center z-10 group-hover:bg-[#C9A84C] group-hover:text-black transition-all duration-300">
        <span class="text-[14px] font-bold font-mono">04</span>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-2">
        <h3 class="text-[20px] font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-[#C9A84C] transition-colors">Sample Approval</h3>
        <p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed text-[15px]">We make samples for your approval.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative flex items-start gap-8 group">
      <div class="absolute left-6 top-12 w-[2px] h-[calc(100%+24px)] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#C9A84C]/40 to-transparent"></div>
      <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-2 border-[#C9A84C] bg-[#050505] flex items-center justify-center z-10 group-hover:bg-[#C9A84C] group-hover:text-black transition-all duration-300">
        <span class="text-[14px] font-bold font-mono">05</span>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-2">
        <h3 class="text-[20px] font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-[#C9A84C] transition-colors">Mass Production</h3>
        <p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed text-[15px]">Once the sample is approved, mass production begins.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative flex items-start gap-8 group">
      <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-2 border-[#C9A84C] bg-[#050505] flex items-center justify-center z-10 group-hover:bg-[#C9A84C] group-hover:text-black transition-all duration-300">
        <span class="text-[14px] font-bold font-mono">06</span>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-2">
        <h3 class="text-[20px] font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-[#C9A84C] transition-colors">Inspection & Delivery</h3>
        <p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed text-[15px]">After quality inspection, we arrange shipment to your destination.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3>Why Our Process Works for You</h3>
  <p>Our 6-step workflow is designed to minimize risk and maximize efficiency. By providing detailed quotations and physical samples upfront, we eliminate guesswork and ensure the final product meets your brand's exact standards.</p>
  
  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-4 my-8 text-white/70">
    <li><strong>Speed to Market:</strong> Our streamlined communication reduces the time from initial selection to sample approval.</li>
    <li><strong>Quality Assurance:</strong> Two distinct inspection phases ensure that mass production matches the approved sample perfectly.</li>
    <li><strong>Global Logistics:</strong> We handle all export documentation, providing a truly "worry-free" door-to-door experience for international partners.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mt-12 p-8 bg-[#C9A84C]/5 border border-[#C9A84C]/20 rounded-2xl">
    <h4 class="text-[#C9A84C] font-bold mb-4">Start Your Partnership Today</h4>
    <p class="text-white/60 mb-6">Ready to take the first step? Download our latest catalog or send us your requirements to receive a free quote within 24 hours.</p>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
      <a href="/#inquiry" class="inline-block bg-[#C9A84C] text-black px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold uppercase tracking-wider transition-all hover:bg-[#b8973d]">Select Styles →</a>
      <a href="#" class="inline-block border border-[#C9A84C] text-[#C9A84C] px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold uppercase tracking-wider transition-all hover:bg-[#C9A84C] hover:text-black">Download Catalog (PDF)</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</GuideLayout>
